Clint: What's your favorite martial arts movie, in fact, what's your favorite martial arts scene?

00:04:33.340 --> 00:04:35.080
Clint: Leave a comment down below

00:04:35.080 --> 00:04:36.100
Clint: We love taking a look

00:04:36.100 --> 00:04:37.800
Clint: We'll break it down on the show right here

00:04:41.200 --> 00:04:48.080
Gui: There's... there's been times on this show, where I've doubled, uh, Turk, where I've been to the verge of tears

00:04:48.460 --> 00:04:49.020
Clint: Whoah

00:04:49.040 --> 00:04:54.980
Gui: Because of how... how... how much it hurts working nights, in New York City, during the fall winter is not fun

00:04:55.060 --> 00:04:55.720
Clint: Okay

00:04:59.680 --> 00:05:02.800
Gui: So, there's a fall here that I wasn't a fan of

00:05:08.520 --> 00:05:09.020
Clint: Ooh...

00:05:09.140 --> 00:05:12.660
Gui: So it's New York City, it's 2 a.m

00:05:13.040 --> 00:05:18.640
Gui: Close to 15 degrees outside and it's about 10 feet... 15 feet

00:05:18.720 --> 00:05:21.980
Gui: They are like, "He's... you're gonna you're gonna hit and splat"

00:05:21.980 --> 00:05:23.660
Gui: I'm like, "Cool. This is gonna be great"

00:05:23.660 --> 00:05:26.660
Gui: "We're gonna put a little neoprene mat for you"

00:05:26.660 --> 00:05:29.080
Gui: And neoprene's like this thick, you know

00:05:29.180 --> 00:05:32.420
Gui: That neoprene was actually harder than the roof

00:05:32.460 --> 00:05:33.300
Niko: Really?
Clint: What?

00:05:33.300 --> 00:05:38.080
Gui: Because when it's cold it stiffens up even more

00:05:38.080 --> 00:05:39.700
Gui: I did that maybe seven times

00:05:39.940 --> 00:05:43.560
Gui: I might as well should have just been landing on the ground without it

00:05:43.640 --> 00:05:48.520
Gui: Because it's not only just the impact, but then it's the freezing burn that comes after it

00:05:48.840 --> 00:05:54.780
Gui: Of your palms getting... scraping across your... your chest, get smacking

00:05:54.780 --> 00:05:57.760
Gui: And that wasn't fun, at all

00:05:57.760 --> 00:05:58.540
Clint: Here's my thing though

00:05:58.620 --> 00:05:59.120
Gui: Hmm?

00:05:59.280 --> 00:06:01.580
Clint: In the edit.... Well, you don't see the full thing

00:06:01.580 --> 00:06:04.260
Gui: Right, there's more to the chase than what they actually showed

00:06:04.640 --> 00:06:07.120
Gui: And they... they cut a good chunk of it out

00:06:07.280 --> 00:06:12.680
Gui: So i'm supposed to land on it... on a lower ledge, then jump to the stairs that you see over there

00:06:13.040 --> 00:06:18.760
Gui: And then i'm supposed to run and instead of go down the last flight i'm supposed to just jump

00:06:19.600 --> 00:06:23.840
Gui: And just try to make it, and that's what we do, but you know, you don't see it in the shot

00:06:23.840 --> 00:06:26.079
Gui: It just looks like I fell from on top of the ledge

00:06:26.240 --> 00:06:32.860
Gui: So again, you do a whole bunch of work and at times you're only going to get a third of it shown, you know, in the edit

00:06:37.600 --> 00:06:39.160
Gui: Charlie Cox is really cool though

00:06:39.160 --> 00:06:41.180
Gui: We were doing squats to stay warm

00:06:41.440 --> 00:06:44.360
Gui: He does squats before every scene, like, before they start action

00:06:44.360 --> 00:06:47.040
Gui: He... he pumps his heart up, he just gets it going

00:06:47.040 --> 00:06:49.340
Clint: Every... like no matter it's cold, no matter it's hot... everything?
Gui: Yep

00:06:49.340 --> 00:06:51.040
Gui: I'm gonna tell him he should come on here

00:06:51.360 --> 00:06:51.860
Niko: Yeah?

00:06:51.860 --> 00:06:53.660
Gui: And then you guys should do an actor's react

00:06:53.720 --> 00:06:54.560
Niko: You think he would do that?

00:06:54.560 --> 00:06:55.660
Gui: I don't see why not

00:06:55.900 --> 00:06:57.880
[Phone chimes]
Niko: Wait, hold on... hold on... hold on

00:06:58.160 --> 00:07:03.400
Niko: Charlie Cox just called me and he said, "Niko i'm not going to go on your show"

00:07:03.680 --> 00:07:05.960
Niko: "Until Corridor Crew gets 4 million subscribers"

00:07:05.960 --> 00:07:09.840
Niko: I'm like you know what, Charlie Cox? We're at 3.91
Gui: Whoah

00:07:09.840 --> 00:07:11.660
Niko: So we just need 90 000 subscribers

00:07:11.920 --> 00:07:13.240
Gui: Come on
Niko: That's right guys

00:07:13.240 --> 00:07:15.500
Niko: Help us get Charlie Cox on the show, right now

00:07:15.780 --> 00:07:16.980
[Fly buzzing]

00:07:17.340 --> 00:07:18.080
[Smack]
Gui: Hey

00:07:18.480 --> 00:07:19.200
