Clint: It's health bar is like down a little bit now
Gui: It's half now

00:07:35.760 --> 00:07:37.360
Clint: Yeah
Gui: It's moving a little slower now

00:07:42.400 --> 00:07:46.560
Niko: So Game of Thrones has some great sword fights and has some not great sword fights

00:07:46.560 --> 00:07:50.380
[Laughter]
Niko: I remember being pretty disappointed with this fight scene

