00:09:27.740 --> 00:09:33.680
Niko: Like, it's cut so roughly and like yeah, just none of the angles flow like they're forcing

00:09:33.680 --> 00:09:35.360
Niko: They're forcing it really hard

00:09:35.360 --> 00:09:37.440
