00:10:25.000 --> 00:10:25.860
Niko: It was an amazing fight scene

00:10:26.000 --> 00:10:26.640
Gui: And

00:10:26.640 --> 00:10:27.860
Niko: The trial by combat

00:10:28.320 --> 00:10:29.300
Niko: Oh, that's a good fight scene

00:10:29.300 --> 00:10:33.800
Gui: Liang is dope, the same dude choreographed and doubled, uh, for that fight scene

00:10:33.840 --> 00:10:38.540
Gui: He is in Mission Impossible Fallout, he fought Henry Cavill and-

00:10:38.640 --> 00:10:41.660
